              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "das Schach — \"chess\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mein Sohn spielt jeden Dienstag Schach im Verein. My son plays chess at the club every Tuesday."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "No plural. Schach! — check! Schachmatt — checkmate."
            }
          ]
        },
